0..48 Comment "//! This fixture defines a cumulative hierarchy."
49..52 Comment "//!"
53..129 Comment "//! A set has a member type and a member function. The hierarchy is a W-type"
130..210 Comment "//! over the universe, after the sets of Aczel as well-founded trees and § 10.5"
211..232 Comment "//! of the HoTT book."
233..236 Comment "//!"
237..317 Comment "//! The checker admits recursive rank calculation. The family occurs only to the"
318..398 Comment "//! right of the arrow of the function. So it is strictly positive. It lives one"
399..435 Comment "//! universe above the member types."
436..439 Comment "//!"
440..520 Comment "//! Limits: the codes that these sets carry have no machine image. So every item"
521..546 Comment "//! checks and none runs."
547..550 Comment "//!"
551..579 Comment "//! - see: Aczel\'s hierarchy"
